# Book Thumbnail Images Directory
# 
# This directory stores resized thumbnail images for books.
# 
# Thumbnail sizes:
# - thumb/ (150x200) - for book cards
# - medium/ (300x400) - for search results
# - large/ (600x800) - for book detail pages
# 
# Naming convention: {book_id}_{size}.{format}
# Format: WebP for optimal compression
